  "comments": "Based on the interpretation of Jo bo 'bum (ID: 5611) and rNgog Blo ldan shes rab (ID: 3786), who is credited with having previously composed such a work in the colophon, presumably in (ID: 6197) or (ID: 6048) according to [BAQ9MH4T]: 202-203, n. 49. These two works - (ID: 6197) and (ID: 6048) - are not extant, and might be identical. The second is entitled \"yum brgyad stong pa'i 'grel pa'i don bsdus\" and the first \"yum brgyad stong pa'i don bsdus,\" but it is said to be based on Haribhadra's interpretation.",
